Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         network-manager (>= 1.2.0),
         zerotier-one
Description: NetworkManager VPN plugin for ZeroTier
 Lets ZeroTier networks be joined and left as VPN connections through
 NetworkManager, nmcli, and GNOME Settings, the same way OpenVPN or
 OpenConnect connections are managed.
 .
 This plugin does not implement any tunneling itself - it talks to the
 already-running system zerotier-one daemon to join/leave networks and
 reports the resulting interface and addresses back to NetworkManager.
